  "solution": {
    "text": "For lens $1: \\mathrm{f}_1=10, \\mathrm{u}=-30, \\mathrm{v}=$ ?\n$v=\\frac{u f}{u+f}=\\frac{-30 \\times 10}{-30+10}=15$\nFor lens 2: $\\mathrm{f}_1=-10, \\mathrm{u}=10, \\mathrm{v}=$ ?\n$v=\\frac{u f}{u+f}=\\frac{10 \\times-10}{10-10}=\\infty$<br />For lens $3: \\mathrm{f}=30, \\mathrm{u}=-\\infty, \\mathrm{v}=$ ?\nSo v will be 30 ."
